SUMMARY:Halloween Edition: Language & Social Event @ Madison Pub by Toront
 o Babel
DESCRIPTION:TorontoBabel: Toronto's International Language Exchange\n🎃
 👻 **TORONTO BABEL HALLOWEEN LANGUAGE EXCHANGE & PARTY!** 🦇🕸️\n\
 nHey friends! Get ready for a spooky night of languages\, new connections\
 , and Halloween fun! 🎃👻 We’re bringing the Halloween vibes to Madi
 son with Halloween decorations\, DJ music\, and a night full of fun! 🪩
 🔥\n\n👻 **Halloween Costume Contest** – Dress to impress and win sm
 all prizes! 🎭🏆\n\n🎧 **DJ Music** – Get ready for great tunes an
 d party vibes!\n\n🕸️ **Halloween Decorations** – We’ll be decorat
 ing Madison with some spooky Halloween touches!\n\n🌎 **Language Exchang
 e** – Practice languages and meet people from around the world.\n\n🎲 
 **Board Games & Socializing** – Make new friends and enjoy a fun night o
 ut!\n\n🧛‍♀️ **Costumes are highly encouraged!** Whether you go sp
 ooky\, funny\, creative\, or totally outrageous\, come dressed up and join
  the fun!\n\n📅 **Wednesday\, October 28**\n⏰ **7:00 PM – 11:00 PM**
 \n📍 **Madison Avenue Pub**\n14 Madison Ave\, Toronto (behind Spadina St
 ation)\n\n💬 Pull up solo or bring a friend—either way\, you’ll leav
 e with new connections\, good laughs\, and even better vibes! 🫶🌟\n\n
 💵 **$5 Entry Donation**\nYour contribution helps cover Meetup costs\, n
 ame tags\, games\, and all the little extras that make the night special! 
 ✨\n\n📲 **E-transfer also available:**\n[tmg8@wealthsimple.me](mailto:
 tmg8@wealthsimple.me)\n\n📸 **Instagram:**\n[https://www.instagram.com/t
 .o.babel](https://www.instagram.com/t.o.babel)\n\n💬 **WhatsApp:**\n[htt
 ps://chat.whatsapp.com/EYMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7](https://chat.whatsapp.com/E
 YMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7)\n\n🔗 **Meetup:**\n[http://www.meetup.com/Toronto
 Babel](http://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel)\n\n📘 **Facebook:**\n[https:/
 /www.facebook.com/groups/torontobabel](https://www.facebook.com/groups/tor
 ontobabel)\n\n👉 **Check out the calendar & RSVP:**\n[http://www.meetup.
 com/TorontoBabel/#calendar](http://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel/#calendar)\
 n\n📝 **Note:** Toronto Babel is a welcoming and safe space for all atte
 ndees. Any form of harassment or inappropriate behavior will not be tolera
 ted. If you experience or witness any issues\, please inform one of the or
 ganizers immediately so we can address it appropriately.\n#toronto #Toront
 oEvents #TodoToronto 🎃👻🖤
