DTSTAMP:20261024T043632Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261031T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261031T230000
SUMMARY:Halloween Pub Crawl & Social Event @ Artful Dodger Pub by Toronto 
 Babel
DESCRIPTION:TorontoBabel: Toronto's International Language Exchange\n🎃
 👻 **HALLOWEEN NIGHT PUB CRAWL – OCTOBER 31** 🦇🍻\n\nHey friends!
  Get your Halloween plans started with Toronto Babel and our **3rd Annual 
 Babelween Pub Craw**l! 🎃 Join us for a fun evening of drinks\, food\, a
 nd socializing before heading out to experience the Halloween vibes on Chu
 rch Street! 👻🕸️\n\n🎟️ **FREE EVENT — Everyone is welcome!**
 \n\n📍 **Location:** Artful Dodger Pub\n🏠 10 Isabella St.\, Toronto\,
  ON M4Y 1N1\n🕕 **6:00 PM – 9:00 PM:** Pre-drinks\, food & socializing
  🍻🍔\n🎃 **9:00 PM onwards:** Halloween walk on Church Street!\n\nC
 ome hang out\, meet new people\, grab a drink\, and enjoy the Halloween at
 mosphere with the Babel crew. At 9 PM\, you're welcome to join us for a wa
 lk along Church Street to check out the amazing costumes and festivities 
 — or head off to your own Halloween parties and plans!\n\n🧛‍♀️ 
 **Costumes are encouraged!** Come dressed up and bring your Halloween spir
 it!\n\n💬🫶🌟 Pull up solo or bring a friend — either way\, you'll
  leave with new connections\, good laughs\, and even better vibes!\n\n🤝
  **Community Guidelines & Safe Space Policy**\nToronto Babel is a welcomin
 g and safe space for everyone. Harassment\, discrimination\, and inappropr
 iate behavior will not be tolerated. If you experience or witness any issu
 es\, please inform one of the organizers so we can address them appropriat
 ely. Let's keep our community fun\, respectful\, and inclusive for all! 
 ❤️\n\n🌐 **Stay Connected with Toronto Babel!**\n\n📅 **Meetup & R
 SVP:** [https://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel/#calendar](https://www.meetup.
 com/TorontoBabel/#calendar)\n\n👥 **Facebook Group:** [https://www.faceb
 ook.com/groups/torontobabel](https://www.facebook.com/groups/torontobabel)
 \n\n💬 **WhatsApp Group:** [https://chat.whatsapp.com/EYMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg
 5bt7](https://chat.whatsapp.com/EYMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7)\n\n📸 **Instagra
 m:** [https://www.instagram.com/t.o.babel](https://www.instagram.com/t.o.b
 abel)\n\n🎃 See you there\, Babel crew! Let's make this Halloween one to
  remember! 🥂👻\n\n#TorontoBabel #TorontoEvents #TorontoNightlife #Hal
 loweenToronto #HalloweenPubCrawl #ChurchStreet #LanguageExchange #MakeNewF
 riends #MeetLearnShare #TorontoHalloween
